    <!-- Pace message (random pick within each mood) -->
    <string name="pace_empty_1">Clean slate. Log your first meal and let\'s make it a good day.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_2">Nothing logged yet. The day is full of possibilities — mostly edible ones.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_3">Empty diary, full potential. What\'s for breakfast?</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_4">Zero kcal so far. Even the fridge is getting suspicious.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_5">Your diary is emptier than the fridge on Sunday night. Fix one of those.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_1">Right on track — keep it rolling.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_2">Nice pacing. Your future self approves.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_3">Steady as she goes. Looking good.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_4">Textbook day so far. Frame it.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_5">Balanced like a Greek philosopher. Nothing in excess.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_1">Easy, champ — that was more than the plan allows for this time of day.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_2">You\'re ahead of schedule. Maybe let the next snack walk on by.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_3">Slow down — at this pace dinner will be a glass of water.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_4">That time-of-day budget is gone. The rest of the day is on thin ice.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_5">Front-loading calories, are we? Your evening self just filed a complaint.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_1">Goal obliterated. Put the fork down and step away from the fridge.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_2">You didn\'t cross the limit, you drove a truck through it. Kitchen\'s closed.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_3">That\'s enough. The couch and a glass of water are your only friends tonight.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_4">Impressive. The goal never stood a chance. Neither did the snacks.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_5">Just apologize to the scale in advance and go to bed.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_gentle_1">Nothing logged yet — a good moment to start the day.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_gentle_2">Fresh start. Log your first meal whenever you\'re ready.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_gentle_3">The diary is empty so far — no rush, just don\'t forget.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_gentle_1">You\'re on track — nicely done.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_gentle_2">Good pace today. Keep it up.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_gentle_3">Everything within plan so far.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_gentle_1">Slightly ahead of plan for this time of day — worth keeping in mind.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_gentle_2">This part of the day is a bit over its share. A lighter next meal helps.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_gentle_3">A little ahead of schedule — consider saving room for later.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_gentle_1">Today went over the goal. Tomorrow is a new day.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_gentle_2">Above the daily goal — it happens. Be kind to yourself and reset tomorrow.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_gentle_3">Over the target today. One day doesn\'t define the week.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_brutal_1">Still nothing logged? The diary doesn\'t fill itself, soldier.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_brutal_2">Zero entries. Zero effort. Zero excuses. Log something.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_brutal_3">An empty diary is just lying with extra steps. Get to it.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_brutal_4">You opened the app just to stare at it? Log your food. Now.</string>
    <string name="pace_empty_brutal_5">The scale already knows what you\'re hiding. The diary wants names.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_brutal_1">On plan. Good. Don\'t you dare ruin it before midnight.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_brutal_2">Acceptable. Barely. Keep marching and nobody gets hurt.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_brutal_3">On track — for once. Screenshot it, nobody will believe you.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_brutal_4">Discipline detected. Suspicious, but I\'ll allow it.</string>
    <string name="pace_ok_brutal_5">You\'re on plan. That fridge stays closed and we stay friends.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_brutal_1">Budget for this time of day: gone. Inhaled. Hope it was worth it.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_brutal_2">You\'re eating like the day has 40 hours. It doesn\'t. Stop.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_brutal_3">Ahead of schedule again. Your dinner is now a rumor.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_brutal_4">That was not a snack, that was a raid. Lock it down.</string>
    <string name="pace_warn_brutal_5">Overshooting this early? Bold. Stupid, but bold.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_brutal_1">Goal destroyed. The kitchen is a crime scene and you\'re the suspect.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_brutal_2">You blew past the limit like it owed you money. Done. Kitchen closed.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_brutal_3">Congratulations, you ate tomorrow\'s calories too. Water. Bed. Silence.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_brutal_4">The goal is dead and you killed it. Walk it off. Literally, go walk.</string>
    <string name="pace_over_brutal_5">Even the fridge is judging you now. Nothing more enters that mouth today.</string>

